[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15791.03, "timestamp": "04:23:11", "text": "我討厭人們總是對這評判那。他跟我講了各式各樣的粉絲類型，像是現在很多粉絲，粉絲的分類是什麼？粉絲的定義是什麼？粉絲群中有很多不同的類型，我發現它們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15795.189, "timestamp": "04:23:15", "text": "只是因為一些八卦，例如……哦，橙色……對，橙色……是的。哦，是的。 Spirit也是那種聲音跟其他人類似的人，對吧？那不是那種讓人困惑的女性嗓音，對吧"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15802.63, "timestamp": "04:23:22", "author": "@WhiteGlint4Answer", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_naBVNcSxiu5dSXWZ9sg7-zrOuDci98mvg4tI6NAFMNEIQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "WHAT DOES ONE DO WITH 29 RUPEES?!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15807.349, "timestamp": "04:23:27", "text": "？我也很驚訝"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15814.79, "timestamp": "04:23:34", "text": "。不，老實說，我最初"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15817.83, "timestamp": "04:23:37", "text": "發現Spirit的時候，我的反應是：「等等，這人是男的，對吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15829.03, "timestamp": "04:23:49", "text": "？」"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15832.149, "timestamp": "04:23:52", "text": "然後我開始感到困惑，開始感到迷茫。然後我突然明白了。哦，等等。原來別人以前也是這麼看待我的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15833.28, "timestamp": "04:23:53", "author": "@WhiteGlint4Answer", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_naBVNcSxiu5dSXWZ9sg7-zrOuDci98mvg4tI6NAFMNEIQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yeah that's a dollar"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15835.235, "timestamp": "04:23:55", "author": "@WhiteGlint4Answer", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_naBVNcSxiu5dSXWZ9sg7-zrOuDci98mvg4tI6NAFMNEIQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "or more"}]